# =======================================================================
# ORCHID CREATION — ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (EXAMPLE)
# =======================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# GitHub Pages serves static files only and CANNOT securely store server-side secrets.
#
# - DO NOT place your YouTube API Key in client-side code (.env) for GitHub Pages.
# - Instead, add your YouTube Data API v3 key as a GitHub Repository Secret:
#     GitHub Repo -> Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions -> New repository secret
#     Secret Name: YOUTUBE_API_KEY
#
# This allows GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/sync-youtube-playlists.yml) to
# safely query the YouTube API in a private runner, regenerate portfolioVideos.json,
# and deploy updated static files without ever leaking your API key to visitors.
#
# If you ever restrict your YouTube API key in Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Restrict Key by API: Select "YouTube Data API v3" only.
# 2. Restrict Key by IP: (Optional) or leave unrestricted for GitHub Action runners.
# =======================================================================

# For local development / running `npm run sync-youtube` locally (OPTIONAL):
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=your_youtube_data_api_v3_key_here

# External Form Backend (OPTIONAL, e.g. Formspree or Web3Forms):
# You can also set this in src/data/siteConfig.ts -> formspreeEndpoint
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id

